WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:07.940
You need three or four fresh pea pods from the grocery store, an apple, a sweet bell

2
00:00:07.940 --> 00:00:12.380
pepper, a ruler, and leaves from one tree or shrub you know is safe to touch.

3
00:00:13.333 --> 00:00:15.973
Open each pod and line the peas up on a plate.

4
00:00:16.913 --> 00:00:18.613
Measure each pea across with a ruler.

5
00:00:19.493 --> 00:00:22.133
An adult cuts the apple and pepper so the seeds show.

6
00:00:23.033 --> 00:00:25.173
Later, look at pictures of animal families.

7
00:00:26.267 --> 00:00:29.087
Peas from one pod are alike, but not identical.

8
00:00:30.127 --> 00:00:33.087
Look for the biggest, the smallest, and any with a different shade.

9
00:00:34.167 --> 00:00:35.407
Stay with your child.

10
00:00:36.327 --> 00:00:37.607
An adult does all the cutting.

11
00:00:38.507 --> 00:00:40.987
Keep peas and seeds away from children under four.
